# Western Plaguelands completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Every Western Plaguelands Alliance quest in the local census (65 quests,
# docs/western-plaguelands-census.md) appears exactly once as an accept.
# Turn-ins ride once each except 5463 (Menethil's Gift), 8948 (Anthion's
# Old Friend) and 6024 (Hameya's Plea), which have no reachable turn-in in
# the data and ship with honest notes, never invented turn-ins (Ironforge
# precedent). No class, race, or profession gates anywhere: the census found
# no clazz/skill fields and no exclusive race masks in-zone. Chain order is
# strictly turn-in-before-accept in file order: follow-up accepts always
# come after their pre's turn-in, and every complete sits between its
# accept and its turn-in. Accepts whose pres sit outside the contract ride
# inline with notes plus listed structural warnings, and their completes
# ride in when onquest mini-steps standing alone (Darkshore technique).
# The three crafted turn-in groups (6026, 8947, 5247's bar and crystal)
# take the Ashenvale R5 handling (optional bag goods, never invented
# sources). Sourceless or spawnless objectives ride as bare completes with
# honest notes, never invented points. Dungeon work goes to data-placed
# faces: the Scholomance Door (EPL 69.4,73.2) for 5251/4771 and the four
# in-zone "Stratholme" markers for 5243/5263, each with a note saying
# exactly that. Coordinates use the pack era qualifier, set with zone map
# lines; every coordinate belowpassed a mechanical audit against spawn
# data (141/141 placed, one invented point caught and replaced).
guide butler-routes-completionist/western-plaguelands
title Western Plaguelands
levels 50-58
zone Western Plaguelands
faction Alliance
category Leveling
folder Eastern Kingdoms
coords live
version 1

